{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Primal Legend - Supporter Pack</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865750/extras/8a9958199f1a687cea937b13fc4f2b05.avif?t=1755012598\" width=1232 height=706 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ascend to sacred heights with the Primal Legend pack, a tribute to the lost Temple of Eterra, a place where marble halls shimmered with blue light, and life was shaped by divine hands. These cosmetics embody reverence, strength, and the serene legacy of creation itself.<br><br><i>This pack contains exclusive <strong>cosmetic-only items</strong> and includes all items from the Traveler, Templar, and Vanquisher packs, along with unique <strong>cosmetic-only items</strong> that do not affect gameplay or power.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This Pack also contains the following Supporter Packs</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Primal Traveler Pack</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865750/extras/e25074af7b280c01c9491a2db9ec281b.avif?t=1755012598\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Primal Templar Pack</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865750/extras/a4184be47e506a7ba534809cb14c5c7b.avif?t=1755012598\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Primal Vanquisher Pack</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865750/extras/208fcec77428298071d964b69418d2b4.avif?t=1755012598\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br>The following items are unique to the Primal Legend - Supporter Pack:\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>300 Epoch Points (EP)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Digital currency to further customize your journey. Use these points to purchase additional cosmetics from the in-game cosmetic shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865750/extras/5df6da4ea0d1bb685afc6a788711d8e7.avif?t=1755012598\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Temple Knight Wings</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sculpted from polished marble and gilded in radiant gold, these wings are both ornament and defense. Blue gemstones shimmer like feathers, as if echoing a higher purpose beyond flight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865750/extras/a3b663954aaf65d3bab9727bb32ebe00.avif?t=1755012598\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Eterra Portal</strong> <i>(Portal Cosmetic)</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made of elegant marble and shimmering gold, this divine gateway opens to reveal a magnificent egress, evocative of Eterra's once beautiful seas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865750/extras/2d2aa1580dada7e804128b4aab555e93.avif?t=1755012598\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Temple Authority</strong> <i>(1H Sword Cosmetic)</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A regal blade with a crystalline blue edge and gold-fused hilt. Shaped like a claw of judgment, this weapon was never forged for war\u2014it was shaped to command peace, and enforce it when necessary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865750/extras/5b44d8ed4319e811d5c88487829fac16.avif?t=1755012598\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Temple Familiar</strong> <i>(Companion Pet)</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An alabaster automaton balancing effortlessly atop a hovering disc, this curious construct glides across the battlefield. Some say it was crafted to clean the temple floors. Others suspect it has always been the true architect.<br>(*Yes\u2014it's a cat on a roomba.*)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865750/extras/c3dca0c2b55d5613d2fc88f48dc16963.avif?t=1755012598\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Temple Attendant</strong> <i>(Companion Pet)</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A silent marble sentinel, this floating relic hovers at your side\u2014watching, listening, remembering. It offers no words, only presence, as if waiting for the world to deserve its voice again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865750/extras/da3073899daf57c6747119fa05d750ec.avif?t=1755012598\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Temple Aegis</strong> <i>(Shield Cosmetic)</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A towering shield of marble and blue stone, ringed in golden filigree and crowned with winglike arcs. The sigil at its center shines gently, as though bearing the last heartbeat of a god.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865750/extras/f21d549ad0e7f99b86d8be3f49cd4d96.avif?t=1755012598\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Temple Knight</strong> <i>(Armor Set Cosmetic)</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adorned in ceremonial white and trimmed in glowing blue, this armor once belonged to the sworn protectors of Eterra's sacred halls. Regal and radiant, it honors strength not just in combat\u2014but in restraint.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865750/extras/d78726184ad248bbf8e2357b3fc311d4.avif?t=1755012598\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Whispering Wind</strong> <i>(Evade Effect Cosmetic)</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your movements trail with translucent wisps of white air, like whispers of breath from the divine. Each step carries the weightlessness of purity and the hush of old prayers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865750/extras/3d7f175a570260b9b8fcf1acb8eac3b0.avif?t=1755012598\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Eterra's Path</strong> <i>(Footprint Effect Cosmetic)</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A gentle blue radiance traces your footsteps, as if the land itself remembers your passage. Tread the forgotten roads of Eterra, where every step rekindles a spark of the past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865750/extras/954de6d8b854d8df6ad532d7c904571b.avif?t=1755012598\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Primal Legend Forum Badge</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crowned with divine sigils and radiant light, this badge marks you as one who carries the grace\u2014and burden\u2014of the Temple's legacy into the Age of Strife.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865750/extras/885600cb3cbcdbe411bf26e4cc3b4e17.avif?t=1755012598\" width=1600 height=291 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3865750?t=1755012598","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3865750?t=1755012598","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865750/00c3e8b6e8f3be42cedddaa038f91cb6ca973acd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755012598","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865750/00c3e8b6e8f3be42cedddaa038f91cb6ca973acd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755012598","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Primal Legend - Supporter Pack</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865750/extras/8a9958199f1a687cea937b13fc4f2b05.avif?t=1755012598\" width=1232 height=706 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ascend to sacred heights with the Primal Legend pack, a tribute to the lost Temple of Eterra, a place where marble halls shimmered with blue light, and life was shaped by divine hands. These cosmetics embody reverence, strength, and the serene legacy of creation itself.<br><br><i>This pack contains exclusive <strong>cosmetic-only items</strong> and includes all items from the Traveler, Templar, and Vanquisher packs, along with unique <strong>cosmetic-only items</strong> that do not affect gameplay or power.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This Pack also contains the following Supporter Packs</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Primal Traveler Pack</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865750/extras/e25074af7b280c01c9491a2db9ec281b.avif?t=1755012598\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Primal Templar Pack</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865750/extras/a4184be47e506a7ba534809cb14c5c7b.avif?t=1755012598\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Primal Vanquisher Pack</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865750/extras/208fcec77428298071d964b69418d2b4.avif?t=1755012598\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br>The following items are unique to the Primal Legend - Supporter Pack:\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>300 Epoch Points (EP)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Digital currency to further customize your journey. Use these points to purchase additional cosmetics from the in-game cosmetic shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865750/extras/5df6da4ea0d1bb685afc6a788711d8e7.avif?t=1755012598\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Temple Knight Wings</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sculpted from polished marble and gilded in radiant gold, these wings are both ornament and defense. Blue gemstones shimmer like feathers, as if echoing a higher purpose beyond flight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865750/extras/a3b663954aaf65d3bab9727bb32ebe00.avif?t=1755012598\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Eterra Portal</strong> <i>(Portal Cosmetic)</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made of elegant marble and shimmering gold, this divine gateway opens to reveal a magnificent egress, evocative of Eterra's once beautiful seas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865750/extras/2d2aa1580dada7e804128b4aab555e93.avif?t=1755012598\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Temple Authority</strong> <i>(1H Sword Cosmetic)</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A regal blade with a crystalline blue edge and gold-fused hilt. Shaped like a claw of judgment, this weapon was never forged for war\u2014it was shaped to command peace, and enforce it when necessary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865750/extras/5b44d8ed4319e811d5c88487829fac16.avif?t=1755012598\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Temple Familiar</strong> <i>(Companion Pet)</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An alabaster automaton balancing effortlessly atop a hovering disc, this curious construct glides across the battlefield. Some say it was crafted to clean the temple floors. Others suspect it has always been the true architect.<br>(*Yes\u2014it's a cat on a roomba.*)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865750/extras/c3dca0c2b55d5613d2fc88f48dc16963.avif?t=1755012598\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Temple Attendant</strong> <i>(Companion Pet)</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A silent marble sentinel, this floating relic hovers at your side\u2014watching, listening, remembering. It offers no words, only presence, as if waiting for the world to deserve its voice again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865750/extras/da3073899daf57c6747119fa05d750ec.avif?t=1755012598\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Temple Aegis</strong> <i>(Shield Cosmetic)</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A towering shield of marble and blue stone, ringed in golden filigree and crowned with winglike arcs. The sigil at its center shines gently, as though bearing the last heartbeat of a god.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865750/extras/f21d549ad0e7f99b86d8be3f49cd4d96.avif?t=1755012598\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Temple Knight</strong> <i>(Armor Set Cosmetic)</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adorned in ceremonial white and trimmed in glowing blue, this armor once belonged to the sworn protectors of Eterra's sacred halls. Regal and radiant, it honors strength not just in combat\u2014but in restraint.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865750/extras/d78726184ad248bbf8e2357b3fc311d4.avif?t=1755012598\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Whispering Wind</strong> <i>(Evade Effect Cosmetic)</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your movements trail with translucent wisps of white air, like whispers of breath from the divine. Each step carries the weightlessness of purity and the hush of old prayers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865750/extras/3d7f175a570260b9b8fcf1acb8eac3b0.avif?t=1755012598\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Eterra's Path</strong> <i>(Footprint Effect Cosmetic)</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A gentle blue radiance traces your footsteps, as if the land itself remembers your passage. Tread the forgotten roads of Eterra, where every step rekindles a spark of the past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865750/extras/954de6d8b854d8df6ad532d7c904571b.avif?t=1755012598\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Primal Legend Forum Badge</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crowned with divine sigils and radiant light, this badge marks you as one who carries the grace\u2014and burden\u2014of the Temple's legacy into the Age of Strife.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865750/extras/885600cb3cbcdbe411bf26e4cc3b4e17.avif?t=1755012598\" width=1600 height=291 /></span></p>","developers":["Eleventh Hour Games"],"fullgame":{"appid":"899770","name":"Last Epoch"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865750/468be66cf11593c089c53b281b4138baabd1c046/header.jpg?t=1755012598","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 Eleventh Hour Games, Inc.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257180502,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257180502/movie480.mp4?t=1755012596","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257180502/movie_max.mp4?t=1755012596"},"name":"Season 3 - Primal Legend","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257180502/a3c11a81c3769b5b978e74f59edddc5